    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Medic 6, Triage class feature</p><p>Once per round, when an ally is knocked unconscious or killed, the medic may move towards them as a free action usable outside of her turn. The medic may spend 2 uses of triage to apply it to the ally after this movement. Once per encounter, this use of triage can be done as part of the same free action, afterwards, using triage this way is an immediate action for that encounter.</p>",
